    dcterms:subject "Cybersecurity Resilience"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Referenced by Article 5(1)(a), (b), (c), (e), (f), (h); Article 5(2), (3), (4); Articles 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11(2)(b), (c), 12(4), 15; Article 1, point 7, Directive"@en .

