    dcterms:subject "Operational Cooperation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Referenced by Article 10(4)(a)-(g), Article 10(6), Article 11(1)(a)-(g), Article 11(2)(a), (b), (c), Article 11(3), (4), Article 13(2), Article 15, Article 16(2)(e)"@en .

