### CSIRTs Network Secure Communications Tools
:Software_CSIRTsSecureCommunications rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual , dcterms:Software ;
    dcterms:title "Secure Communications Tools for CSIRTs Network and EU-CyCLONe"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Secure communication infrastructure deployed within the CSIRTs network and EU-CyCLONe, provided by legal entities not established in or controlled by third countries"@en ;
    dcterms:publisher :Agent_ENISA ;
    dcterms:creator :Agent_ENISA ;
    dcterms:isReferencedBy <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/XXXX/oj/eng/art_10/par_2> ,
                           <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/XXXX/oj/eng/art_10/par_3> ,
                           <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/XXXX/oj/eng/art_10/par_5> ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Provide secure communication channels for CSIRTs network"@en ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Serve as secretariat infrastructure for EU-CyCLONe"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Referenced by Article 10(2), (3), (5). Security requirements mandate providers not controlled by third countries. Accessibility and reusability details are not public information."@en .

