    rdfs:comment "Referenced by Article 79. Compliance with accessibility and reusability guidelines applicable as per Article 84(2), 89(7), 74(10)."@en .

### Third Country Exemptions Register
:Software_ThirdCountryExemptionsRegister rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual , dcterms:Software ;
    dcterms:title "Register of Third Country Exemptions"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Publicly accessible register of Commission decisions regarding exemptions for entities established in or controlled by third countries posing cybersecurity concerns"@en ;
    dcterms:publisher :Agent_Commission ;
    dcterms:creator :Agent_Commission ;
    dcterms:isReferencedBy <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/XXXX/oj/eng/art_107> ,
                           <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/XXXX/oj/eng/art_105/par_4> ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Maintain public register of exemption decisions"@en ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Display names of entities subject to decisions"@en ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Ensure regular updates"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Referenced by Article 107. Commission maintains publicly accessible register stating entity names. Regular updates required."@en .

### Competent Authorities Cooperation Platform
:Software_CompetentAuthoritiesNetwork rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual , dcterms:Software ;
    dcterms:title "Network Platform for Competent Authorities Cooperation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Platform for cooperation and exchange of information between the Commission and competent authorities of Member States"@en ;
    dcterms:publisher :Agent_Commission ;
    dcterms:creator :Agent_Commission ;
    dcterms:isReferencedBy <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/XXXX/oj/eng/art_113> ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Facilitate cooperation between competent authorities"@en ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Enable secure information exchange"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Referenced by Article 113. Commission provides administrative support. Not publicly accessible - restricted to competent authorities only."@en .

### Registry of Essential and Important Entities (NIS2)
:Software_NIS2EntitiesRegistry rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual , dcterms:Software ;
    dcterms:title "Registry of Essential and Important Entities under NIS2"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Registry maintained by ENISA containing essential and important entities as well as entities providing domain name registration services as per NIS2 Directive"@en ;
    dcterms:publisher :Agent_ENISA ;
    dcterms:creator :Agent_ENISA ;
    dcterms:isReferencedBy <https://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2022/2555/oj/eng/art_27> ;
    dcterms:conformsTo :Standard_NIS2Directive_Art21 ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Maintain registry of essential entities"@en ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Maintain registry of important entities"@en ;
    lomo:hasCapability "Track domain name registration service providers"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Referenced by Article 1, point 11 (amendment to NIS2 Directive). Based on information received from single points of contact according to Article 27 NIS2. Enables reusability of entity information across compliance processes."@en .

